;redcode-94
;name Decoy Adapter v7
;author ZoreWars
;strategy v6.1 plus a third P-space arm: a 5-line mirror clear (the nano-mirror-clear block, Iron Throne's design scaled to 25200) booted 600 cells behind the body, which then serves as a decoy. Arms in order of trial: decoy oneshot, then paper, then the clear; each keeps a score (win +1, loss or tie -1). v6.1: v5 (oneshot + SPL/DAT d-clear behind a 4800-cell code-like decoy, scan skips its own footprint) with sne.f; the boot writes P-space once and then erases itself.
SPAN    equ 4989
gate    equ clear-4
first   equ bptr-1+1271
